{"id":"2ede40bba0ec9355","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-ladder-system.md","title":"ZFC Ladder System","display":"df-zfc-ladder-system — ZFC Ladder System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ladder-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ladder-system"],"display":"df-zfc-ladder-system — ZFC Ladder System","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-order-type]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ladder-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ladder-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ladder-system — ZFC Ladder System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type\">../batch11/58-df-order-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\vec A\\in V\">\\(S,\\vec A\\in V\\)</span> (index set and ladder-system function candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality operator), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\)</span> (order-type predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LadderSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LadderSystem}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LadderSystem}_S(\\vec A,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,S,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\neq 0\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in\\delta\\;(\\delta=\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land A_\\delta\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\sup A_\\delta=\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta),A_\\delta,\\in\\cap(A_\\delta\\times A_\\delta)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LadderSystem}_S(\\vec A,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,S,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\neq 0\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in\\delta\\;(\\delta=\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land A_\\delta\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\sup A_\\delta=\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta),A_\\delta,\\in\\cap(A_\\delta\\times A_\\delta)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each index is explicitly a nonzero limit ordinal, and each ladder is a cofinal subset whose inherited order has type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The ladder system is a set function into its actual set-valued range; the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is not used as a function codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\vec A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LadderSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ladder\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LadderSystem}_S(\\vec A,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,S,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\\land\\\\\n&\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\\land\\delta\\neq 0\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\beta\\in\\delta\\;(\\delta=\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land A_\\delta\\subseteq\\delta\n\\land\\sup A_\\delta=\\delta\n\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\bigl(\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta),A_\\delta,\\in\\cap(A_\\delta\\times A_\\delta)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2402","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-ladder-system.md|58-df-zfc-ladder-system]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["5d2cd56a38a81b7a","315ad00b8744fdfc","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}